WEBVTT

00:08:59.201 --> 00:09:00.452
like the back of our hands

00:09:00.452 --> 00:09:02.288
because it's our future to inherit.

00:09:03.289 --> 00:09:06.584
But we also know that the future
we deserve cannot be built

00:09:06.584 --> 00:09:09.712
on the unstable foundations
of fear and anxiety.

00:09:11.171 --> 00:09:12.172
It must be built

00:09:12.172 --> 00:09:16.218
with one of the few infinite resources
that we have on this finite planet:

00:09:16.218 --> 00:09:17.219
hope.

00:09:17.428 --> 00:09:19.013
So we choose climate optimism.

00:09:19.096 --> 00:09:21.432
We choose to fight
for the future that we deserve.

00:09:21.724 --> 00:09:22.933
And I hope you will, too.

00:09:22.933 --> 00:09:23.934
Thank you.

00:09:24.143 --> 00:09:25.144
(Applause)